      C("We ___ taken a taxi — the station was very close.", ["needn't have", "shouldn't", "mustn't have"], "needn't have", "Зайва дія → needn't have.", "Лишнее действие → needn't have.", tp="modals-past-criticism"),
      C("It was free, so we ___ pay.", ["didn't need to", "needn't have", "shouldn't have"], "didn't need to", "Не треба і не робили → didn't need to.", "Не нужно и не делали → didn't need to.", tp="modals-past-criticism"),
